<title>BAHRAIN: Islamic Dev't Bank unit to list on Bahrain bourse.</title>
<headline>Islamic Dev't Bank unit to list on Bahrain bourse.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of the Islamic Development Bank's Unit Investment Fund would be listed on the Bahrain Stock Exchange (BSE) from January 2, the exchange said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;Trade in the shares will start on Thursday, January 2,&quot; a BSE statement said.</p>
<p>The Unit Investment Fund has a paid-in capital of $350 million and operates as a vehicle to mobilise funds for the Jeddah-based Islamic Development Bank to boost economic development in its Islamic member states.</p>
</text>
